  "prefLabel": "Liq 301.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 301.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to set forth the manner in which liquor and wine representatives or manufacturers of spirits, wines, and nonalcoholic products apply to have items sold through the commission in the state of New Hampshire, and the manner in which the commission lists and delists, spirits, wines, and nonalcoholic products for sale in the state.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Liq 300) #14018, eff 7-3-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
}
